<section class="hol-body"><header class="hol-banner"><h1>{{actorName}}</h1><p>Supply check after use</p></header>
{{#if target}}<p><strong>{{target.name}}</strong> · Quantity {{target.quantity}} · {{#if out}}Supply out{{else}}Supply d{{die}}{{/if}}</p>{{else}}<p>No supply check is available.</p>{{/if}}
<p class="hol-note">Use this after the DA approves the use. A result of 1 lowers the item’s supply; other results leave it unchanged. This check changes only supply.</p>
{{#if pending}}<section><h2>Saved check</h2><p>{{pending.target.name}} already has a supply check waiting.</p>{{#if reserved}}<p class="hol-note">No result was saved. Do not roll again. The DA should enter the observed result; a note is optional.</p>{{#if gm}}<div class="hol-pair"><label>Observed result<input name="retainedFace" type="number" min="1" max="{{pending.target.inventoryDie}}" step="1" required></label><label>Note (optional)<input name="recoveryReason" type="text"></label></div><button type="button" data-action="recover">Record observed result</button>{{/if}}{{/if}}{{#if result}}<p class="hol-note">A result was saved. Apply it without rolling again.</p>{{#if gm}}<button type="button" data-action="resume" class="hol-primary">Apply saved result</button><div class="hol-pair"><label>Note (optional)<textarea name="abandonReason" rows="2" placeholder="Only if the character or item changed"></textarea></label></div><button type="button" data-action="abandon">Close check without changing supply</button><p class="hol-note">Only use this when the character or item changed after the result was saved. The saved result remains available for review.</p>{{/if}}{{/if}}</section>{{else}}{{#if out}}<p class="hol-note">This item’s supply is out.</p>{{else}}{{#if owner}}<label>Completed use note (optional)<textarea name="reason" rows="3"></textarea></label><button type="button" data-action="check" class="hol-primary">Check supply after use</button>{{else}}<p class="hol-note">Only an owner or the DA can check this item’s supply.</p>{{/if}}{{/if}}{{/if}}</section>
